{"description":"This one is our Community Give Back Day with Toronto Downtown West BIA, and the last Chess in the Park of the season. Bring warm clothing to donate. We will be at The Deck in Clarence Square from 11am to 4pm.\nEnjoy live music and play the game we all love. Whether you’re a grandmaster, a beginner, or have never played chess, this event is for you. All are welcome!","organizer":"KNIGHTCAP Toronto"}